<title>MALAYSIA: SOCCER-SEMIFINAL RESULTS AT WORLD YOUTH CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SEMIFINAL RESULTS AT WORLD YOUTH CUP.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the semifinals at the Youth World Cup Finals on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Argentina 1  Ireland 0</p>
<p>Halftime: 0-0</p>
<p>Scorer: Bernardo Romeo 54  </p>
<p>Uruguay 3 Ghana 2</p>
<p>Halftime: 2-1</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Uruguay -- Marcelo Zalayeta 12, Walter Coelho Alves 44,</p>
<p>Alvaro Perea 104 (golden goal)</p>
<p>Ghana -- Odartey Lawson 44, Alejandro Melono Botta 78 (own</p>
<p>goal)</p>
</text>
